# ── Nested Git repository (frontend has its own .git) ────────────────────────
# The frontend/ directory was bootstrapped with Create Next App and contains
# its own .git history. Git will treat it as a submodule/gitlink unless the
# nested .git is removed before initialising the parent repo.
# See PUBLISHING.md for the safe steps to handle this.
frontend/.git/
